WEBVTT

42:31.700 --> 42:34.495
So we went out to look
for some of his men -

42:34.620 --> 42:37.206
capture them,
gather some knowledge.

42:37.331 --> 42:40.876
The wildlings who fight
for Mance Rayder are hard men.

42:41.001 --> 42:43.087
Harder than you'll ever be.

42:43.212 --> 42:45.714
They know their country
better than we do.

42:45.840 --> 42:48.300
They knew there was
a storm coming in.

42:49.385 --> 42:52.888
So they hid in their caves
and waited for it to pass.

42:54.056 --> 42:56.475
And we got caught in the open.

42:56.600 --> 42:58.394
Wind so strong

42:58.519 --> 43:02.565
it yanked 100-foot trees
straight from the ground, roots and all.
